  "details": "Steps to reproduce:\n\nOpen VRChat.\n\nOpen a user's menu.\n\nSend a Boop.\n\nRepeat this with multiple different users consecutively.\n\nAfter sending Boops to a certain number of users, try to Boop another user who has not been booped.\n\nExpected behavior:\n\nI should be able to Boop the user normally.\n\nActual behavior:\n\nThe user is incorrectly shown as already being booped, even though I have not booped them. I cannot send a Boop to them.\n\nThis seems to occur after sending Boops to a certain number of different users consecutively.",
